  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Guaiba Lake Basin Environmental Recovery</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Recuperacin Ambiental Cuenca Guaiba</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE BASIC OBJECTIVE OF THE PROGRAM IS TO HELP DECONTAMINATE AND RECOVER THE GUAIBA LAKE BASIN. BY TAKING ACTIONS THAT HELP TO ELIMINATE THE MAIN POLLUTANT SOURCES. THE PROGRAM WILL ALSO SEEK TO ESTABLISH A FOUNDATION FOR FURTHER STAGES THAT WILL CREATE THE ADEQUATE CONDITIONS FOR FUTURE FOMENTING ECONOMIC ACTIVITY IN URBAN AND RURAL AREAS OF THE REGION.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
